function portalCue(c,d,p,indoor=false){if(indoor){if(interiorGroundAtlas){c.save();c.beginPath();c.rect(d.x-50,d.y-18,100,40);c.clip();c.fillStyle=artPattern(c,interiorGroundAtlas[5]);c.fillRect(d.x-50,d.y-18,100,40);c.restore();}stone(c,d.x-69,d.y+4,23,p);stone(c,d.x+69,d.y+4,23,p);return;}if(environmentAtlas){atlasProp(c,'cypress',d.x-63,d.y+3,66,110);stone(c,d.x+58,d.y+4,28,p);}else{ruin(c,d.x-76,d.y,1,p);stone(c,d.x+58,d.y+4,28,p);}}
